---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import femaleSupportAgent from '../../assets/female-customer-support-agent.jpg';
---

<section class="section relative">
  <div class="container-page grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-16">
    <div class="reveal text-center lg:text-left">
      <p class="chip text-label-sm">One connected AI receptionist</p>
      <h2 class="text-headline-lg mt-6 text-on-surface">Your Complete AI Receptionist</h2>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-5">
        <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
          Customers reach businesses in different ways. Some call, some start a website chat, some send an email
          and others submit a form or reply by text.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
          Ralvie gives every customer an immediate and consistent experience across each of these channels. It
          understands what the customer needs, provides accurate information and moves the conversation towards
          the right outcome.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
          Instead of managing separate tools for calls, messages, forms and follow-ups, your team can manage every
          customer interaction through one connected AI receptionist platform.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal">
      <Image
        src={femaleSupportAgent}
        alt="Female customer support agent wearing a headset"
        class="front-office-image aspect-[6/5] w-full rounded-3xl object-cover object-top"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .front-office-image {
    border: 1px solid rgb(143 159 255 / 42%);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px rgb(143 159 255 / 10%),
      0 22px 55px rgb(2 5 18 / 38%);
  }
</style>
